  journey: {
    eyebrow: 'The Journey',
    title: 'It started with a simple idea: Bring mindfulness where students are every day',
    lead: 'In 2011, Inner Explorer was founded as a nonprofit with a mission of bringing daily mindfulness to education.',
    body: [
      'Rather than adding another curriculum for teachers to deliver, Inner Explorer built an audio-guided approach that could fit naturally into the school day, giving classrooms a consistent way to practice attention, self-awareness, and emotional regulation together. Inner Explorer’s approach was informed by the sequencing and principles of Mindfulness-Based Stress Reduction (MBSR), adapting daily practice for students from early learning through high school.',
      'From the beginning, the goal was not simply to introduce mindfulness. It was to make daily practice practical enough to last.',
      "In 2025, Inner Explorer became a hybrid organization, a structure built to grow our impact over time. Inner Explorer, Inc. is a mission-aligned company focused on innovation and reach, continually improving how daily mindfulness gets into classrooms. Inner Explorer Institute operates through fiscal sponsorship with Legacy Global Programs, a 501(c)(3), so donors can fund access for schools and classrooms that couldn't otherwise afford it. Together, they share one goal: daily mindfulness for every student, regardless of a school's ability to pay.",
